[00:29.38] Now it's the same as before
[00:35.84] And I'm alone again
[00:51.34] With no sorrow for myself
[00:56.86] And I'm blaming no one else
[01:13.20] And closing my eyes
[01:16.94] And seeing you standing there
[01:57.76] Now it's the same as before
[02:01.82] You've touched me with your love
[02:19.18] And though you're in my heart
[02:23.04] We're still a world apart
[02:38.18] As now I'm back to the time
[02:43.66] Where I would search for a dream
[02:48.76] But no use to try anymore as before
[02:54.62] Someday I'll die, and maybe then I'll be with you
[03:34.76] So I'm closing my eyes
[03:39.26] To hear the people laugh
[03:53.88] For they're all aglow
[03:58.76] Not knowing where to go
[04:13.38] But is it asking too much
[04:16.90] When the question is what to do
[04:21.42] With the life I'll have
[04:25.86] It seems I know nothing now
[04:31.42] Except my love for you
[04:36.82] And the strength in my hands
[04:41.12] To go on feeding your smile
